@startuml seq_view_booking
title Increment 6 - View Booking (FR-RS-04)
autonumber
hide footbox

actor Guest
actor Receptionist
boundary "Guest / Staff UI" as UI
control "Booking Management API" as API
control "Access Control" as Auth
database "Hotel Database" as DB

== Guest views one booking ==
Guest -> UI : Enter booking reference and secret code
UI -> API : Request booking details (reference, code)
API -> Auth : Apply rate limit and verify credentials
Auth -> DB : Find reference and retrieve stored code hash
DB --> Auth : Record/hash or no match
Auth -> Auth : Verify supplied code against hash
alt Unknown reference, invalid code, or rate limit
  Auth --> API : Access denied
  API --> UI : Generic error; no booking details
else Verified guest credentials
  Auth --> API : Authorized for this reservation only
  API -> DB : Load permitted details and current status
  DB --> API : One reservation
  API --> UI : Display this booking only
  UI --> Guest : Show status and booking details
end

== Receptionist views a booking ==
Receptionist -> UI : Search using signed-in staff account
UI -> API : Request booking details (reference, staffSession)
API -> Auth : Check staff session and Receptionist permission
alt Not authorized
  Auth --> API : Deny
  API --> UI : Access denied
else Authorized Receptionist
  Auth --> API : Allow staff lookup
  API -> DB : Load permitted reservation details
  DB --> API : Reservation details
  API --> UI : Display booking to staff
  UI --> Receptionist : Show booking
end

note over UI,Auth
  A guest's code never grants access to another booking
  or the guest's full hotel history.
  Staff authorization never requires the guest's code.
end note
@enduml
